      "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:00:47.210Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I have been using Odoo for about a year but have been looking for my own self hosted version to which I came across ERP Next by Frappe and it looks really good with many features, but the accounting is killing my interest for using this big time. Due to the way I work 90% of the accounting / tax stuff just take so much time and I am unable to even fully set it up.</p>\n<p>I really want to use ERP Next for a lot of its features, but the accounting module just has far to much for a 1 man team.</p>\n<p>Is there a way to use a more basic module? I do want accounting and cost management but I need something that’s worth my time as I am only able to set this up after hours.</p>\n<p>Any feedback is appreciated<br>\nJuan</p>",
